OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 device sparks recycling centre
OL,4,Aevacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recycling centre in Shropshire was
OL,7,Fevacuated after a member of the public
OL,8,Fdropped off a suspected World War Two
OL,9,Fexplosive device.
OL,11,FHortonwood Recycling Centre in Telford
OL,12,Fwas temporarily closed on Tuesday after
OL,13,Fthe item was discovered on site.
OL,15,FThe centre later reopened, with Telford
OL,16,Fand Wrekin Council confirming at 13:15
OL,17,FBST that it had resumed normal
OL,18,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
